    "show_share": true,
    "description": "Only one in a hundred people in Pakistan survive a cardiac arrest, one of the deadliest types of medical emergencies, according to the findings of a new registry run by researchers at Aga Khan University in partnership with 12 public and private hospitals in Karachi.",
